hazards:
Post edit server gaps (posts/[id]/route.ts:280-397):
- no rate limit on PATCH;
- it accepts empty content;
- tags are not re-derived, and trending reads posts.tags (trending/hashtags/route.ts:84), so editing '#foo' out of a caption keeps it trending;
- there is no edited_at column, so no client may claim 'edited'.
The client batches must guard empty text posts and send content only.
